# BrandBlitz API — manual request collection
#
# Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) and
# JetBrains HTTP Client. Routes mirror docs/openapi.yml.
#
# Start the API first: pnpm --filter @brandblitz/api dev (listens on PORT, default 3001).
#
# Authenticated requests need:  Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
# Get an accessToken + refreshToken from "Google callback" below, then paste
# them into @accessToken / @refreshToken.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token-here
@challengeId = paste-challenge-id-here

### ─── Auth ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Google callback: exchange a Google ID token for a BrandBlitz session
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "paste-google-id-token-here"
}

### Current user (authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rotate access + refresh tokens
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (invalidate the refresh token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### ─── Challenges ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List active challenges (paginated; pass nextCursor back as ?cursor=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/challenges?limit=10

### Get one challenge and its questions (authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/challenges/{{challengeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Leaderboard ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Top-N leaderboard for one challenge
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard/{{challengeId}}?limit=10
